Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 19:22:56 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 054/128] feat: add manual link previews

Add only-added preview mode and an action to attach a preview to any URL.

Constraint: Only-added mode must not block explicitly attached previews

Rejected: Persist manual flag into cloud drafts | DraftMessage has no custom field and local sidecar needs separate design

Confidence: medium

Scope-risk: moderate

Not-tested: Manual preview add and only-added mode on device
